  "final_id": "014",
  "title_cn": "委内瑞拉涉嫌行贿者被捕",
  "dek_cn": "佛罗里达州",
  "body_cn": "一名在美国被通缉的商人，他被指控向委内瑞拉高级官员行贿，以换取在委内瑞拉获得有利可图的政府合同，已被拘留。\n\n阿尔瓦罗·普利多于2019年和2021年在迈阿密联邦法院被起诉，这是对他的长期商业伙伴阿莱克斯·萨博的调查的一部分。阿莱克斯·萨博曾是现已被罢免的总统尼古拉斯·马杜罗的盟友。",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": null
 },
 {
  "id": "E1-015",
  "page": "A2",
  "section": "U.S. News",
  "title": "Man Charged in Officer’s Death",
  "dek": "PHILADELPHIA",
  "byline": "—Associated Press",
  "body_en": "Authorities charged Eric Lewis, 35, with homicide in the killing of a police officer Saturday, Philadelphia District Attorney Larry Krasner said.\n\nShane Seiber, 40, was shot and killed after responding to a report of a man with a gun, police said. An officer who was with him was shot 12 times and is in stable condition, Commissioner Kevin Bethel said.",
