  "final_id": "015",
  "title_cn": "一名男子因涉嫌导致一名警员死亡而被起诉。",
  "dek_cn": "费城",
  "body_cn": "费城地区检察官拉里·克拉斯纳表示，当局以涉嫌杀人罪起诉了埃里克·刘易斯，现年35岁，他涉嫌于周六杀害了一名警察。\n\n警方称，肖恩·塞伯，现年40岁，在接到关于一名持枪男子的报告后出警，并在此过程中被枪杀。与他一同出警的警察被枪击12次，目前情况稳定，凯文·贝塞尔表示。",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": null
 },
 {
  "id": "E1-016",
  "page": "A2",
  "section": "U.S. News",
  "title": "Man Targets His Family, Killing Eight",
  "dek": "PENNSYLVANIA",
  "byline": "—Associated Press",
  "body_en": "A man killed eight people including a pregnant woman, children and other relatives at his home in Erie, Pa., before taking his own life as well, authorities said.\n\nErie Police Chief Rick Lorah said the 45-year-old man was related to seven of the victims in Friday's shooting, while the eighth was a friend of the pregnant woman.",
  "priority": "P3",
  "type": "brief",
  "turn_to": null,
  "terms": [
   {
    "en": "Rick Lorah",
    "zh_suggested": "里克·洛拉",
    "note": "伊利市警察局长，待查"
   }
  ],
  "final_id": "016",
  "title_cn": "男子袭击家人，造成八人死亡。",
  "dek_cn": "宾夕法尼亚州。",
  "body_cn": "警方表示，这名男子在宾夕法尼亚州伊利市的家中枪杀了包括一名孕妇、儿童和其他亲属在内的八人，之后自杀。\n\n伊利市警察局局长里克·洛拉表示，这名45岁的男子与周五枪击事件中的七名受害者有亲属关系，而第八名受害者是该孕妇的朋友。",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": null
 },
 {
  "id": "E1-017",
  "page": "A2",
  "section": "U.S. News",
  "title": "At Least 4 People Die in Hurricane",
  "dek": "SOUTH",
  "byline": "—Associated Press",
  "body_en": "At least four deaths were linked to Isaias, including two people killed when trees fell onto homes in Florida and Alabama.\n\nThe first hurricane of the Atlantic season, Isaias came ashore as a Category 2 hurricane Friday near Destin, Fla., and then roared into Alabama with tropical-force winds before heading farther north.",
  "priority": "P3",
  "type": "brief",
  "turn_to": null,
  "terms": [
   {
    "en": "Isaias",
    "zh_suggested": "伊萨亚斯",
    "note": "大西洋飓风季首个飓风"
   }
  ],
  "final_id": "017",
  "title_cn": "至少有四人死于飓风。",
  "dek_cn": "南部地区。",
  "body_cn": "至少有四人因伊萨亚斯飓风丧生，其中包括在佛罗里达州和阿拉巴马州，两名居民因树木倒塌砸中房屋而遇难。\n\n伊萨亚斯是本年度大西洋飓风季的第一场飓风，它于周五在佛罗里达州德斯廷附近登陆，强度为二级飓风，随后以热带风暴级别的风力席卷阿拉巴马州，并继续向更北的方向移动。",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": null
 },
 {
  "id": "E1-018",
  "page": "A2",
  "section": "U.S. News",
  "title": "Aftermath of Hurricane Isaias",
  "dek": null,
  "byline": null,
  "body_en": "Islam Mahfuz salvaged the contents of his destroyed mini mart in the aftermath of Isaias in Milton, Fla., on Saturday. The storm was the first hurricane of the Atlantic season. (Photo: GERALD HERBERT/AP)",
  "priority": "P3",
