  "byline": null,
  "body_en": "The left flank of the Democratic Party raises and spends only a fraction of what many Republicans and the Democratic establishment do on elections. But as the far left gains momentum, supporters are working to expand their funding. Millions of dollars are flowing to help Democratic socialists and other progressives. Scan this code to get a detailed look.\n\nData shown: Michigan $12.7 million; Pennsylvania $9.1 million (scale markers $10 million and $1 million).\n\nNote: Includes 24 progressive PACs and advocacy groups. Jan. 1, 2025, through Oct. 7. Source: AdImpact.",
