 {
  "id": "E1-036",
  "page": "A8",
  "section": "World News",
  "title": "Pope Plans Surgery To Remove Nodule",
  "dek": "VATICAN",
  "byline": "—Associated Press",
  "body_en": "Pope Leo XIV announced Sunday he will undergo surgery \"in the coming days\" to remove a nodule on his lung, in the first major health event of his 17-month pontificate.\n\nThe 71-year-old Leo said the nodule was found at an early stage and was \"circumscribed\" or small and well-localized. The Vatican said Leo's expected recovery time from surgery would be a week.\n\nThe American pope made the announcement during his Sunday noon blessing in an unusual display of transparency about his health. The Vatican didn't say when the surgery would take place.\n\nA lung nodule is a small abnormal area measuring less than 1 inch that sometimes appears on a CT scan, according to the American Cancer Society. If the nodule turns out to be cancerous, the prognosis is \"excellent\" since it will have been removed at an early stage and surgery alone might be all Leo needs in terms of treatment, he said.\n\nLeo has no previously known health problems and is physically active, with weekly tennis matches and swimming at the papal summer retreat in Castel Gandolfo.",
  "priority": "P2",
  "type": "article",
  "turn_to": null,
  "terms": [
   {
    "en": "Pope Leo XIV",
    "zh_suggested": "教皇利奥十四世",
    "note": "美国籍教皇"
   },
   {
    "en": "American Cancer Society",
    "zh_suggested": "美国癌症协会"
   },
   {
    "en": "Castel Gandolfo",
    "zh_suggested": "冈道尔夫堡",
    "note": "教皇夏宫"
   }
  ],
  "final_id": "036",
  "title_cn": "教宗计划接受手术切除肿块。",
  "dek_cn": "梵蒂冈",
  "body_cn": "教宗良十四世周日宣布，他将在“未来几天”接受手术，以切除肺部的一个结节，这是他担任教宗 17 个月期间首次面临的重大健康问题。\n\n这位 71 岁的教宗表示，该结节是在早期阶段发现的，并且“范围有限”，即体积小且位置明确。梵蒂冈表示，教宗良十四世预计术后恢复时间为一周。\n\n这位美国教宗在周日午间的祝福仪式上做出了这一声明，这是一种罕见且公开地披露自己健康状况的方式。梵蒂冈没有说明手术的具体时间。\n\n根据美国癌症协会的说法，肺部结节是指在 CT 扫描中偶尔出现的、小于 1 英寸的小异常区域。如果该结节被确认为癌性，那么预后将是“极好的”，因为该结节将在早期阶段被切除，而且仅通过手术，教宗良十四世可能就能得到充分的治疗。\n\n教宗良十四世此前没有已知的健康问题，并且身体状况良好，每周都会进行网球比赛，并在位于冈道尔夫堡的教宗夏季住所游泳。",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": "无"
 },
 {
