   },
   {
    "en": "Muthaiga Country Club",
    "zh_suggested": "穆泰加乡村俱乐部",
    "note": "内罗毕，待查"
   },
   {
    "en": "Meryl Streep",
    "zh_suggested": "梅丽尔·斯特里普"
   },
