 {
  "id": "E2-003",
  "page": "A10",
  "section": "News",
  "title": "Virtual Binoculars (Sevastopol Bay map)",
  "dek": null,
  "byline": null,
  "body_en": "Infographic accompanying “Video Cameras Are Hacked for War.” Title: “Virtual Binoculars.” Intro text: “Team OneFist, an international hacker group supporting Ukraine in its war with Russia, took control of a camera in Sevastopol, the largest city in Ukraine's Crimean peninsula, which Russia has occupied since 2014.”\n\nMap labels: Sevastopol Bay; Sevastopol; UKRAINE; CRIMEA; “Helicopter tracked to this area”; numbered markers 1–4.\n\n1. The camera was located on a tall building on the city's west side near the coast.\n\n2. The camera's vantage point gave the hackers a wide view of the surrounding area and the Black Sea.\n\n3. The hackers were able to rotate and zoom the camera, allowing them to monitor Russian helicopters, submarines and ships.\n\n4. The hackers tracked a Russian military helicopter to a location near a local airport where they discovered a previously unknown Russian air base.\n\nCaption: “Team OneFist shared the information with Ukrainian forces, who launched attacks against the base soon after, damaging Russian planes and air-defense systems.”",
  "priority": "P3",
  "type": "photo_caption",
  "turn_to": null,
  "terms": [
   {
    "en": "Sevastopol Bay",
    "zh_suggested": "塞瓦斯托波尔湾"
   }
  ],
  "final_id": "045",
  "title_cn": "虚拟双筒望远镜（塞瓦斯托波尔湾地图）",
  "dek_cn": null,
  "body_cn": "配图说明：“摄像头被黑客入侵用于战争”。标题：“虚拟双筒望远镜”。导语：“OneFist团队，一个支持乌克兰对抗俄罗斯的国际黑客组织，控制了位于乌克兰克里米亚半岛最大城市塞瓦斯托波尔的一台摄像头。俄罗斯自2014年起占领了该地。”\n\n地图标注：塞瓦斯托波尔湾；塞瓦斯托波尔；乌克兰；克里米亚；“直升机被追踪到该区域”；编号标记1-4。\n\n1. 这台摄像头位于城市西侧一栋高楼上，靠近海岸。\n\n2. 摄像头的视角为黑客提供了对周围区域和黑海的广阔视野。\n\n3. 黑客能够旋转和调整摄像头的焦距，从而可以监视俄罗斯的直升机、潜艇和舰船。\n\n4. 黑客追踪了一架俄罗斯军用直升机，将其定位到一处靠近当地机场的地点，在那里他们发现了一个此前未知的俄罗斯空军基地。\n\n图说：“OneFist团队与乌克兰军队分享了这些信息，乌克兰军队随后立即对该基地发动了袭击，损坏了俄罗斯的飞机和防空系统。”",
  "context_cn": null,
  "context_attr": "无"
 },
