    "note": "待查, pulmonologist"
   },
   {
    "en": "Melissa Little",
    "zh_suggested": "梅丽莎·利特尔",
    "note": "待查"
   },
   {
    "en": "Center for Nicotine & Tobacco Research",
    "zh_suggested": "尼古丁与烟草研究中心",
    "note": "University of Virginia"
   },
