  "dek": "These indexes cite notable references to most parent companies and businesspeople in today's edition. Articles on regional page inserts aren't cited in these indexes.",
  "byline": null,
  "body_en": "INDEX TO BUSINESSES\n\nA: Alphabet...B1; Amazon.com...B1; Apollo Global Management...A1\nB: Bayerische Motoren Werke...B3; Berkshire Hathaway...B7\nC: ChargePoint...B1\nD: Delta Air Lines...B1; Dutch Bros...B3\nE: e.l.f. Beauty...B3; EVgo...B2\nF: Ford Motor...(page cut off in print)\nG: General Motors...B3\nI: IREN...B2\nK: KB Home...B7\nL: Lennar...B7; Levi Strauss...B3; Lowe's...A12\nM: Macy's...B3; Mercedes-Benz Group...B3\nP: Palantir Technologies...B1,B2; Paren...B2\nR: Reckitt...B1; Robinhood Markets...B1\nS: Samsung Electronics...B3; Starbucks...B3; Stellantis...B3\nT: Tesla...B1,B2\nU: United States Antimony...B2\nV: Volkswagen...B3\nW: Walmart...B1,B2; Warby Parker...B3\n\nINDEX TO PEOPLE\n\nA: Andreev, Alexey...B3\nB: Bastian, Ed...B1; Bittan, Alexander...B2\nC: Chen, James...B2\nE: Edsman, Colin...B2\nF: Ferro, Bill...B2\nG: Glover, Rawdon...B3; Gordon, Tiya...B2; Guenser, Josh...B3\nH: Huang, Vivien...B4\nJ: Johnson, Markese...B2\nL: Licht, Kris...B1; Lovallo, John...B7\nM: Mitchell, Adrian...B3; Musk, Elon...B2\nO: O'Rear, Sara Brescia...B2\nP: Palacios, Rick...B7; Pinto, Edward...B7; Pugh, Florence...B3\nS: Singh, Harmit...B3\nT: Tenev, Vlad...B1\nW: Wilmer, Rick...B1\nZ: Zakrzewski, Kitty...B2; Zakrzewski, Lance...B2",
